    "notes": "Independent Yerevan Kiosk Q6040439 / OSM way969327995 v14 / native35185341416827. The source page names Revan Köşkü/Yerevan Kiosk and Q6040439. Exact original four-corner canopy retained; internal+X southeast places the faceted room toward the garden end and internal+Z southwest faces the pool court. Existing standard Protomaps20261020/Mapzen extract and original161x161/6m grid retained. Uncovered provider internal[-14,0] is outside every native building. Original grid is nearly flat at this small pavilion and does not resolve the photographed garden terrace drop. No custom terrain/precinct flattening; do not approve historical thresholds or accessibility. Only the occupied canopy floor opens the ground; lower garden stair stays behind retained native terrain where its drop is unresolved. Main pavilion footprint, floor seating and signed garden/pool facing inspected in clear native views. Native fit accepted as an approximate exterior. The unresolved garden drop leaves much of the lower modeled stair/basement buried; historical garden-level fit is not approved. Only way969327995/native35185341416827 is replaced. All258 independent resident records of259 and572 wider records of573 retain original geometry, including the Sacred Relics chamber, Sofa Kiosk and Mosque. Original161x161/6m terrain/roads/3400906.0006393427square metres water remain unchanged. Four actual overlapping PMTiles cases13/14/15 pass, including the detailed parent. Provider internal[-14,0] remains uncovered and outside all573 original buildings; modelWorldY approximately0. Outside pool court remains covered. Failure retains259 originals; each LOD unload restores ground/water and zero live geometry. Each requested graph read once. Native fixture renders this member against original map context, not all fourteen authored palace members together."
